This repository analyses and derives from the Kyverno policy library:

    https://github.com/kyverno/policies
    commit ef9843f08d25b3555fe69616f8612c9f915af5d4
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The files under converted/ are machine translations of policies from that
library into Kubernetes ValidatingAdmissionPolicy / MutatingAdmissionPolicy
form, and the CSV files under results/ contain per-policy metadata derived
from it (policy name, path, rule types, matched kinds).

The original policy sources are not vendored here. Obtain them from the
upstream repository at the commit above.
